00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:40.030
This teleportation experiment is very dangerous.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:44.830
I didn't say anything because I know you will try to stop me.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:47.920
But I promise that I'll return.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:56.340
So don't worry about me. I love you, Father, Mother, Grandpa, Danny, Francis... and Helen.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.300
-- Christopher Thorndyke

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.890
Sonic...

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:11.900
Chris?

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:15.280
I did it! I succeeded!

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.700
I made it to Sonic's world!

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:19.700
Sonic!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.580
Huh?

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:35.570
Episode 54

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:35.570
The SpaceShip, Blue Typhoon

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:40.010
No way! What's going on? My body shrank?

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.760
Chris, long time no see!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:42.890
Tails...

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.350
How are you?

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.270
How'd you get here?

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.730
Everyone...

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.600
You surprised us!

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:52.440
Can you give me a second?

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.820
Who is he?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.030
He's a friend.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:58.990
Sonic...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.740
Yo, Chris.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:04.240
I finally made it here.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.580
And I did it on my own.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.790
I knew you'd be able to.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:13.500
Sonic, you haven't changed at all. Nor have the others.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.460
Not at all...

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.170
You haven't changed either, except for your baggy clothes.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.590
But it doesn't matter as long as you're doing well.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.390
You're wrong! This is...

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.730
Sonic!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:30.810
What's wrong?

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.850
Hey!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.770
Pull yourself together, Sonic!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.360
He's fine. He just passed out.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.070
I had a feeling that he wasn't his usual self.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.610
What happened?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.540
This day has been full of injuries.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.800
That robotic monster is called Metarex.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.220
Metarex...

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:06.050
They're attacking numerous planets in the universe.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:14.230
Their goal is to conquer and rule the universe using force.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:21.150
Many planets in the galaxy have fallen before their overwhelming power.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:29.370
When they conquer a planet, they take its Planet Egg, the crystallization of the planet's life energy.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:33.710
I don't know why they're doing this.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.500
However, many planets have already died.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:43.840
When a planet loses its Planet Egg, it loses the power to create life.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.800
Including this planet?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.810
I understand, but who are you anyway?

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.430
Me?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:56.270
Are you the one who brought them here?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:01.440
No! Metarexes are robotic monsters with no heart!

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.150
Don't group me in with them!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.240
I don't trust you!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.860
Knuckles!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:13.450
I came to tell Sonic of this crisis because he's the hero who can control the Chaos Emeralds.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:18.750
Metarex killed my entire race and all my friends.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:23.550
I don't want anyone to have to go through what I did!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.310
It sounds bad.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.060
You came at the right time, Chris.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.770
It's encouraging to have you here.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:38.810
It's incredible that it only took you six months to create a machine that can bring you here.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:39.980
Six months?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:44.030
No wonder none of you have changed.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.740
But you haven't changed either, Chris.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.870
Six years have passed in my world.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.830
I'm 18 years old.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.080
What?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.750
What is it?

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.580
Chris, for an 18 year-old...

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.830
He's tiny.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.750
I grew taller, but I shrank!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:06.590
There must have been a glitch during teleportation.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:09.340
That's a pretty big error!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.050
What's passed is past.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.930
I'm sure it'll all work out.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.640
You sound just like Sonic.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.690
Sonic!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.560
He's gone!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.230
It's open.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.030
He ran away!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.200
Sheesh, he always does this the moment he feels better.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.620
He can't stay still.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.370
He hasn't changed at all.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.640
The wind has stopped...

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:55.100
Chris arrived from here.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.640
But there's nothing here.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.180
What are you doing?

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.440
Oh, it's you.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:04.360
Is it true that the Chaos Emeralds are gone?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:08.610
Yeah. Sonic scattered them throughout the universe.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.990
Sheesh!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.570
Not only does Metarex attack us, but Chris also shows up.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.490
I have no clue what's going on!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.040
Hey, you're ignore me?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.130
How rude! You get the information you want and split!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.250
Sheesh!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.460
Forget you!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.380
I made this from memory.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.970
It looks like it'll fit perfectly.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.180
Thank you.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.180
I never thought I'd be wearing this again.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:41.140
The sky is beautiful.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:45.310
It will make us happy if you like our planet, Cosmo.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.650
Yes.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:49.740
I must protect this planet.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:54.820
Metarex has no right to take away their happiness.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.790
I can't let them create any more unhappy worlds.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.120
Cosmo.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.880
We have Sonic, so we'll be fine.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.840
But the Chaos Emeralds are gone...

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.220
Then all we have to do is search for them.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.970
Sonic...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:18.470
Sorry, it's my fault that I had to send the Chaos Emeralds away.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.350
I was playing around too much.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.810
Chaos Control!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.450
I should never have let my guard down.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.420
Sonic, you weren't really hurt back then?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.210
Yeah.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:51.420
But it was the first enemy I couldn't defeat when I was in my Super mode.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.880
Sonic...

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:59.760
My people have traveled throughout space to find a way to beat Metarex.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:06.600
Metarex attacked and killed everyone, but I came here to carry on their legacy.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.150
That's why I...

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.440
Don't worry!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:15.570
We'll collect the Chaos Emeralds, defeat Metarex and get Planet Egg back!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:16.740
All right?

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:21.580
We're going beyond the heavens to search for the Chaos Emeralds.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.660
It sounds like it'll be a great adventure!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.000
We need a spaceship!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:33.170
I'll help too! It must be fate that I arrived at this moment in time.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.430
Okay, let's go to outer space!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.850
But if we start making the spaceship now, won't it take months to build?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.480
About that...

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:48.770
Ta-daa!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.740
Wow!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:01.080
I made this just in case Eggman was up to no good again.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:04.040
It's Typhoon, the multi-functional mobile fortress!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:11.290
It was originally designed to operate on the planet, but if I remodel the engines, it can become a spaceship!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.210
However...

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.250
However?

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.470
I planned to use the Chaos Emeralds as its power source.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.470
Without them...

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.850
We can use that!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:26.520
Where did that bat girl go?

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.100
No way!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.610
And even more no way!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.820
Okay! Looks good.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:41.410
This will provide enough power for the interstellar drive.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.410
Hey!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.370
What are you punks doing!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.250
Hi, Knuckles! We're borrowing the Master Emerald for awhile.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.130
I never said I'll let you borrow it!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.210
We're going to outer space.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.710
Outer space?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:11:00.300
We're going to collect the Chaos Emeralds and stop Metarex's plans.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:05.010
In order to succeed, not only do we need the Master Emerald, but we need your help too!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:07.220
Let's all work together!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.390
You assume too much!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:12.310
Hurry up and give me back the Master Emerald!

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.610
Knuckles, I'm really disappointed in you!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.610
The fate of the universe is at stake!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.490
You're unbelievable!

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.990
You don't care what happens as long as the Master Emerald is safe?

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:28.330
Wait, hold up!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.330
Sonic!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.500
There's nothing scarier than refusing a lady's invitation, Knuckles.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:41.010
The energy chamber converts it into energy.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.380
Do you understand?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.930
Fine, I'll work.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.510
He's fast.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.100
Chris.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.520
I'm sorry to get you involved in a terrible situation just when you arrived.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.860
Don't worry about it. I'm really excited right now.

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.940
I know I can help Sonic and everyone this time.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.280
Is the navigation program okay?

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.530
We have to ask Knuckles to start the ignition experiments.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:10.200
This reminds me of the time when I used to do experiments with Chuck.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.460
Since we're going through the trouble of building a spaceship, let's equip it with lots of devices.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.590
Super devices that would make Grandpa jealous!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.170
That's a good idea!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.480
Do not let them launch.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:35.600
Stop them from building the spaceship immediately.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:57.630
Tails is pumping the water we need.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.710
He asked us to load the food.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.010
We'll be able to leave soon.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.470
Tails and Chris are incredible!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.680
Cosmo.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.730
Will you help us?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.350
Sure!

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:17.060
Are you all right?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.560
Leave it to me!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.650
Cosmo!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.200
Ouch...

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.820
Cosmo!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.830
Are you all right?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.200
Yes...

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.510
That's...

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:55.140
For tranquility and order, I will purge the fools who stand against us.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.190
Adjusting for error margin. 0.28 to the right.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.450
Like I thought, normal attacks don't hurt it!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.120
But we have to fight!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:24.960
You disturb order. I won't let you off this planet.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.970
That's Metarex?

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.760
It found out about our spaceship.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.260
Tails, what's the status?

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.480
The hull and navigation system are almost complete.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.940
The rigging isn't finished yet, but we can work on it mid-flight.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.150
That means...

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.910
What? Right now?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:54.280
Yeah. We're going to activate the Master Emerald, so go get Knuckles.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.540
Sorry for all the confusion.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.790
You can say that again!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.170
Cream, tell Knuckles to return to the ship.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.340
Cosmo, you and I will load as much food as possible until the last minute.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:07.920
That means...

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.930
Tails and Chris have a plan.

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.600
They're going to start the ship and take off.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.560
Too slow!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:33.820
What's the matter, big guy?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.620
Knuckles!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.340
Engines are ready!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:01.440
It would be embarrassing if a hedgehog was struck by spikes.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.200
I hope you learned your lesson!

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.750
Knuckles!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.210
Please come right away! Tails is going to take off!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:25.630
Now?

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.260
I'll take care of things here!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:39.720
That's good enough. Let's load everything.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.350
Okay.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.190
You don't have to overdo it.

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.570
System all green.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.780
Connecting main engine to the flywheel! Ignition!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.660
Connecting main engine to the flywheel.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.050
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.510
Chaos is power.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.930
Power comes from the heart.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.600
The one who masters that also controls chaos!

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:25.730
Ignition!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.280
Engine ignition confirmed.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:44.790
Mother...

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:51.670
Mother, may I stay at Tails's place?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.880
You mean the spaceship?

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.550
Make sure you don't get in their way.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:58.510
Yes, Mother!

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:00.760
Cream?

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.350
Mother... Bye.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.820
Aren't you ready yet?

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:17.860
Tails?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.370
Increasing thrust!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.460
11,600,000 tons!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.000
We can launch now!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.970
I won't let you leave!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:42.890
Whoa!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.020
I won't let you lay a finger on our spaceship.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:59.610
Master Emerald, please lend me your powers!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:05.200
Reaching critical point: 70... 80... 90... 95...

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:08.120
100! Energy transfer complete!

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.290
Sonic, we're using the main cannon! Standby!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:21.640
Connecting energy from the engine chamber to the cannon's hammer!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.430
Pressurizing the cannon rod's ring energy!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.940
Sonic, start your spin!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.020
Okay!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.490
Everyone, brace for impact!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.330
Trigger safety off!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.420
Targeting Metarex straight ahead!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.430
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.380
Sonic!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.670
Sonic!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:43.180
Chris...

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.600
Sonic!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.860
I retrieved Sonic!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.360
Bridge confirms! Let's go!

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:02.530
Stowing main cannon!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.780
Transferring energy to the main engine!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.450
Opening atmosphere insulation wings!

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:14.500
Blue Typhoon taking off!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.930
Let's go to the bridge.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:47.360
I wonder what our planet looks like from outer space?

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:53.700
What's this?

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:57.420
How long has this been here?

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:03.210
Sonic found the bug.

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:08.760
I would never rescue Sonic out of the goodness of my heart!

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.890
Let's also take off!

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.270
Roger!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:16.850
Igniting the engine!

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:20.940
Crimson Egg, take off!

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:22.820
That's not for you to say!

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:25.110
How dare you steal my lines!

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:55.220
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:55.220
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:55.220
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

